ir base on Marineros Island accompanied by the Stygis Squadron, compound Kataphraktoi. Meanwhile, the Deucalion arrives at the United Forces of Earth’s Trident Base, but some of the soldiers there are not fond of a unit that is equipped with Aldnoah.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvbztRNUPwGab8kWaSwA1mfnf7F.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 14","synopsis":"At the Vers Empire’s frontline stronghold in Earthspace, Slaine leaves for their base on Marineros Island accompanied by the Stygis Squadron, compound Kataphraktoi. Meanwhile, the Deucalion arrives at the United Forces of Earth’s Trident Base, but some of the soldiers there are not fond of a unit that is equipped with Aldnoah.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvbztRNUPwGab8kWaSwA1mfnf7F.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10846","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20853","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"27655","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61259","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"279827","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"369","synopsis":"The Mars Knights have assembled at Marineros Island. Slaine tries to take part in the battle, but he is looked down upon by his erstwhile fellow knights because he was born on Earth. Elsewhere, the crew of the Deucalion prepares for battle at Trident Base. Learning of the existence of Slaine’s swift Tharsis, they are wary of its capabilities.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mWyY60iwQTguu2UhD5KL0NZbeji.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 15","synopsis":"The Mars Knights have assembled at Marineros Island. Slaine tries to take part in the battle, but he is looked down upon by his erstwhile fellow knights because he was born on 